+## 8. Voxel fluid CA: hydrostatic target + gradient chains (2026-07-21)
+
+**Gameplay truth:** CPU `UpdateFluidCA` (driver `VoxelWorldFluid.cpp` + engine
+`VoxelWorldFluidBodies.cpp`). Default rate 5 Hz (`simulation.fluidTickRateHz`).
+Spec: `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-20-fluid-ca-hydrostatic-chains-design.md`.
+
+**Mass model:** binary Fluid. `fluidFill` 0/255 storage; ignored by CA.
+`fluid_ca.comp` research; `PROJECTV_FLUID_CA_GPU` default **OFF**.
+
+**Pipeline per tick:** FALL (contiguous runs shift down by 1) тЖТ bodies тЖТ
+**basins** (union-find over touching floods тАФ one disc per basin) тЖТ reachability
+flood тЖТ target T (bottom-up by (y, stickiness); octant round-robin by radius,
+budget shared across 8 octants) тЖТ distance D to T тЖТ chains (K=8/body for
+T-spread; every active fall-entry exit emits 1/tick, heads-first by y).
+
+**Sources (2026-07-21):** excess bottom on settled support тАФ grounded, тИЙT, below
+is Solid or FluidтИИT. On consume: **column settle** (same-body fluid above the
+source drops one cell into the vacancy) тАФ net top of the column shrinks, streams
+stay contiguous. Guard `(y_src > y_dst) || (same y && D_src > D_dst)`. тЙд1 chain
+per (x,z) column per tick. Bay fallback: fillable Air with тЙе3 body neighbours,
+loose source тЙд1 neighbour (loose may be тИИT тАФ T prefers stick-0 fluid over Air
+holes). Lone cell: T = itself тЖТ never moves.
+
+**Wake/idle + frame cap:** `fluidEditSerial` bumps on **any** material change
+(breaking glass wakes the CA) and `RebuildVoxelWorldDerivedState`;
+`lastFluidCaSerial` gates the idle early-out. ECS runs тЙд2 `UpdateFluidCA` per
+frame and drops accumulator backlog.
+
+Tests: `ProjectVFluidCATests` (N1 per-column top-shrink, N2 no-teleport + exit
+budget, N3 stream continuity, N4/N8 sphere-break, N5 idle, N6 glass-wake, N7
+overflow, N9 stray merge, N10 side-breach contiguous stream).
+
+**Archives:** `legacy/docs/archive/2026-07-17-fluid-ca-base-drain-attempt/`,
+`legacy/docs/archive/2026-07-20-fluid-ca-bfs-pressure-attempt/`.
 
